space  Recipes › Git · ~/work › Plan

Up to 5 steps in each of 6 repos  4 at a time · ≈ 3 m 0 s · nothing has run yet

  1  Create the backup folder                                                                                    SAFE
     $ mkdir -p ~/.local/state/space/git

  2  Back up branches  one file per repo, kept 30 days                                                           SAFE
     $ git -C ~/work/ml-experiments bundle create ~/.local/state/space/git/ml-experiments.bundle fix/login exp/webgl…

  3  Delete branches  30 in total                                                                          REVERSIBLE
     $ git -C ~/work/ml-experiments branch -D fix/login feat/old exp/webgl a b

  4  Forget old history  reflog keeps deleted commits alive                                              IRREVERSIBLE
     $ git -C ~/work/ml-experiments -c gc.reflogExpireUnreachable=now reflog expire --all
     After this the deleted commits can only come back from the bundle.
  5  Compact  this is where space comes back                                                                     SAFE
     $ git -C ~/work/ml-experiments gc --prune=now
